  "adaptationNotes": [
    "Runtime child receipts and legacy workspace layout are excluded.",
    "Mining arguments require explicit Site technology identifiers.",
    "shared_synth.tcl accepts an explicit SDC and emits raw library visibility markers for both arms.",
    "init.tcl.tmpl uses documented setNanoRouteMode -routeTopRoutingLayer.",
    "charlib_emit.py writes per-cell prediction outputs and logs inside the Campaign attempt; no fixed /tmp path.",
    "pnr.tcl.tmpl exports the active post-route SDC for clock evidence; Innovus 23.14 support remains an L4 Site bring-up item.",
    "Shared DC and Innovus liveness queries use qualified library/cell patterns and collection cardinality rather than Tcl list length."
  ]
